.Dd September 3, 2026
.Dt VDOTS-PUBLISH 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm vdots-publish
.Nd turn a Markdown file into a listen-along session
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl -voice Ar V
.Op Fl -tone Ar T
.Op Fl -pace Ar P
.Op Fl -force
.Op Fl -open
.Op Fl v | Fl -verbose
.Ar FILE.md
.Nm
.Fl -info Ar FILE.md
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the friendly wrapper around
.Xr vdots-listen 1 Ic publish :
it prints a pre-flight parse report, then runs the full pipeline
.Pf ( frontmatter No \(-> chaptered audio \(-> per-sentence transcript \(-> WebVTT
captions \(-> readability report \(-> article page \(-> catalog )
into
.Ev $VDOTS_LISTEN_DIR
.Pq default Pa ~/ai/outbox/listen ,
which Google Drive desktop syncs to every device.
It is the same thing
.Ic :VdotsReadPublish
does from Neovim.
.Pp
A
.Pa <base>.spoken.md
sibling (a speech-ready doc with a read-aloud frontmatter block) is published
in place of
.Pa <base>.md ;
.Fl -raw
opts out. Re-publishing the same source is an idempotent no-op unless
.Fl -force
(or a newer
.Ic generated_at
in the frontmatter).
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "-v, --verbose"
.It Fl -voice Ar V
macOS voice name. Default: the best installed voice for the tone.
.It Fl -tone Ar warm Ns | Ns Ar clarity
Voice character when auto-picking. Default
.Ar warm .
.It Fl -pace Ar follow Ns | Ns Ar relaxed Ns | Ns Ar natural
Delivery preset (rate + time-stretch + pause lengths). Default
.Ar follow .
.It Fl -force
Re-record over a not-newer session
.Pq Ic :VdotsReadPublish! .
.It Fl -open
Open the catalog
.Pq Pa index.html
when done.
.It Fl -raw
Publish the named file as-is, ignoring a
.Pa .spoken.md
sibling.
.It Fl v , Fl -verbose
Narrate every pipeline step to stderr and un-mute
.Xr say 1
and
.Xr ffmpeg 1 .
.It Fl -info , Fl -dry-run
Pre-flight parse report only \(em no audio, no write.
.El
.Sh OUTPUT
Under
.Pa $VDOTS_LISTEN_DIR/<YYYY-MM-DD-title-slug>/ ,
files named for their role:
.Pa audio.mp3
(Drive/Android plays it inline; transcript embedded as an id3 lyrics frame),
.Pa audio.m4a
(same audio, faststart + chapters, for Apple Music / VLC),
.Pa document.md , report.md , transcript.txt , captions.vtt , article.html ,
.Pa meta.json ,
and
.Pa assets/
(cues.json, readability.json, chapters.vtt, spoken.txt).
Plus
.Pa readalong.mp4
(the transcript scrolling with the narration \(em plays in Drive's video
player),
.Pa brief.md
(a self-contained analysis brief to open in Gemini), and \(em for
interview-prep packs \(em
.Pa manifest.md
(a research kit: a map of every relevant file plus web links, so an AI chat
can research the job independently). The catalog
.Pa index.md
is the phone surface; the
.Pa article.html
player only runs in a real browser (Drive's preview sandboxes it).
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr vdots 1 ,
.Xr vdots-guide-image 1 ,
.Xr vdots-listen 1 ,
.Xr vdots-read 1 ,
.Xr vdots-readability 1 ,
.Xr vdots-readalong 1
